        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="W74ufKOaL8kAzsfGnLAT-65" value="1. Frame (before) and the object what we looking for is the input for the VLM and Depth models.&lt;div&gt;2. Output is a Caption of the frame, the object location in the frame, the distance of the object from the camera&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Collector collects the VLM/Depth output, add timestamp, gps, temp, pressure data and pass it to the LLM for command and confidence score generation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. The command and confidence is generated by the LLM in JSON format and a middleware layer verify if above certean level eg. 90% the drone can fly without human interaction.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. The command is validated and finetuned in the real world (if the command is not valid by the LLM a human is finetuning it)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Decision point: The command needs to be acceptable&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Frames during movement added to the same VLM/Depth model&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. Output for all the frame is the Caption, object location, distance.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8. Collector collects the VLM/Depth outputs, add timestamp and IMU data for the whole movement and wait for the user to allow to be sent to the Learning dataset&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;9. Collector wating for user trigger to be sent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;10.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Verification&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;positive/negative reinforcement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;11. Learning dataset is updated with a new entry, data agmentation is needed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;12. Confidence score is needed from the LLM in the future after the learning procedure done to automate eg. above 90% score&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;An accepted learing dataset consists:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Input: before data (Direction, distance + GPS, temperature, pressure data)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Output: JSON formated c&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ommands, Confidence score&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Input: after data (Direction, distance + IMU,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;GPS, temperature, pressure data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Possible VLM model:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Moondream,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Qwen 2.5 VL,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;LLaMA 3.2 Vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Possible Depth model:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;MiDaS,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Apple Depth Pro,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;DepthFM,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Depth Anything V2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Possible LLM model:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Llama 3.1,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Qwen3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Simulations: Gazebo or Airsim&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="720" width="640" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
